1
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:13,000
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:15,930
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:17,039 --> 00:01:18,500
I will handle this matter.

4
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:20,690
What do you think about

5
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,680
keeping him somewhere

6
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:23,980
he can't get out of?

7
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,850
That's up to you.

8
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:27,770
If you can get him thrown in jail,

9
00:01:27,770 --> 00:01:29,900
it'll be a great blessing to the world.

10
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,750
What's your plan?

11
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,500
That depends on what you want.

12
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,130
For all these years,

13
00:02:57,520 --> 00:03:00,030
they've treated me like a dog.

14
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,690
I want everything Zhao Xiao has.

15
00:03:10,310 --> 00:03:11,170
What about you?

16
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:15,040
Don't worry.

17
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:17,190
He won't get in Xiao's way.

18
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,400
Only when Xiao succeeds

19
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:21,520
can our whole family prosper.

20
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,400
I have

21
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:24,720
reminded Zhao Fang of this many times.

22
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,079
He understands.

23
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:27,800
By the way,

24
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,850
there's a dinner tonight.

25
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:31,710
Mr. Pei and several investors

26
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:33,240
are meeting with Zhao Xiao.

27
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:34,800
I have something to take care of,
so I can't make it.

28
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,260
Go with Zhao Xiao instead.

29
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:39,350
But

30
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,890
those men are tough to handle,

31
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,020
especially when it comes to drinking.

32
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:47,079
I'll ask Zhao Fang to come along, too.

33
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,000
He should be able to handle them.

34
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,770
Really?

35
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,150
That's great!

36
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:55,590
I want the most damning evidence

37
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,870
against Zhao Xiao.

38
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,590
Let's go.

39
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:26,940
[Thursday, July 3, 2025]

40
00:04:31,310 --> 00:04:33,440
What are you planning to do with these?

41
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,760
What do you think?

42
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,250
Sometimes it's what the clients want.

43
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:39,650
Other times,

44
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:43,110
it's a way to threaten people
who won't cooperate.

45
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:49,240
This was Zhao Xiao's idea, wasn't it?

46
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:52,170
Who else would come up
with something so despicable?

47
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:54,840
But he doesn't want
to get his hands dirty,

48
00:04:55,510 --> 00:04:57,080
so I've always handled it.

49
00:04:57,650 --> 00:05:00,510
Even Lin Di'er, his own wife,
has no idea about this.

50
00:05:03,050 --> 00:05:05,710
[Thursday, July 3, 2025]

51
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,600
So, in his eyes,

52
00:05:06,390 --> 00:05:09,320
people without power
are nothing but sitting ducks,

53
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,800
easy prey for anyone to exploit.

54
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:31,490
[Thursday, July 3, 2025]

55
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:41,870
The one in the red dress, number three.

56
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:44,670
The short-haired one in the corner,
number seven.

57
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,090
[Actor's Filming Agreement]

58
00:06:05,470 --> 00:06:07,920
[Legal Representative
/ Authorized Representative Signature: Cui Peng]

59
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,500
Everything's ready.

60
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:19,560
The first group will be up in a minute.

61
00:06:31,190 --> 00:06:32,000
Everyone,

62
00:06:33,310 --> 00:06:35,110
tonight's special auditions

63
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:36,600
are about to begin.

64
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:40,720
Sounds good.

65
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,250
I'd like to propose a toast.

66
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,240
Cheers.

67
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:01,070
What's this?

68
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,680
These are all the assets

69
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:09,140
I've managed to find
belonging to Zhao Xiao.

70
00:07:11,030 --> 00:07:11,440
[Zhao Xiao's Asset List]

71
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,020
[II. Vehicle Assets]
[III. Financial Assets]

72
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:15,240
You've done so much for them,

73
00:07:16,230 --> 00:07:17,240
yet what you own

74
00:07:17,430 --> 00:07:19,560
is less than one percent of their wealth.

75
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,720
Zhao Xiao and Lin Di'er

76
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,830
are already going
through divorce proceedings.

77
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:24,030
Once Zhao Xiao falls,

78
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:27,480
you'll be Chen Jihong's only son.

79
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:31,950
And all of this will be yours.

80
00:07:36,270 --> 00:07:37,670
You're quite something.

81
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,970
But there's still one thing I need:

82
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:51,070
a witness who can bring him down

83
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,000
once and for all.

84
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,630
You think I'm a fool?

85
00:07:59,190 --> 00:08:01,040
You want me to walk right into a trap?

86
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,480
You want me to take 800 losses
just to inflict 1,000 on him?

87
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,280
Is that what you call helping me?

88
00:08:06,310 --> 00:08:08,310
Turning yourself in is the only way.

89
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,890
I can get you the best lawyer.

90
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,270
If you don't act first,

91
00:08:17,010 --> 00:08:18,670
you'll end up taking the blame

92
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:20,740
for all the dirty dealings.

93
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:53,310
[Wishing "Love at the Cost of Her Skin"
a Great Start!]

94
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:51,910
Second bow.

95
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,740
Third bow.

96
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,630
I'm so glad you all

97
00:08:59,650 --> 00:09:01,340
could join us for the opening banquet
of "Love at the Cost of Her Skin".

98
00:08:59,780 --> 00:09:02,670
[Wishing "Love at the Cost of Her Skin"
a Great Start!

99
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,130
It's been a long and challenging journey.

100
00:09:03,130 --> 00:09:05,000
We've been preparing
for this project for a long time,

101
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,790
and today we're finally ready
to begin filming.

102
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:07,440
I hope I can count on

103
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,820
-everyone's support...
-Xu.

104
00:09:08,820 --> 00:09:10,690
-In the days ahead. And I hope...
-You handled his PR brilliantly.

105
00:09:10,690 --> 00:09:12,480
-This drama will be a huge success!
-This is Zhao Xiao's first drama

106
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,960
since the last scandal,

107
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,770
and judging by the turnout,

108
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,790
it seems he hasn't been affected at all.

109
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:19,520
Well, he had to do his part, too.

110
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,330
Absolutely.

111
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,160
I'd also like to thank all my fans

112
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:27,270
for coming to my opening banquet today.

113
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,960
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

114
00:09:29,010 --> 00:09:32,150
-Zhao Xiao is the most handsome!
-Zhao Xiao is the most handsome!

115
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:32,680
[Yingcheng Bank]

116
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:33,280
[Your Yingxin Card ending in 9527]

117
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:33,950
[Received 3,000,000 from another bank]

118
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:39,290
[Zhao Xiao: A Glamorous Date]

119
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:39,970
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

120
00:09:39,290 --> 00:09:39,900
[Zhao Xiao: Shining on the Road Ahead]

121
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,370
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

122
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:45,170
[Police]

123
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:45,320
-Xiao!
-Xiao!

124
00:09:46,990 --> 00:09:49,080
-Make way! Make way!
-Xiao! Xiao!

125
00:09:53,990 --> 00:09:54,590
Zhao Xiao.

126
00:09:54,790 --> 00:09:56,030
Zhao Fang has turned himself in.

127
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,150
He's suspected
of illegal business operations.

128
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,670
We need you to come with us
to the police station

129
00:09:58,670 --> 00:10:00,600
to assist with our investigation.

130
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,420
Officer,

131
00:10:04,490 --> 00:10:05,900
what's going on?

132
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,520
Everyone, this may be a misunderstanding.

133
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:11,120
But I need to cooperate
with the police investigation right now.

134
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:13,520
I'll explain everything to you afterward.

135
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:33,410
[Police]

136
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,530
Having a great time
in a private VIP room, huh, Xiao?

137
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:36,650
[Zhao Xiao, the man behind Spotlight Bar,]

138
00:10:36,670 --> 00:10:37,440
[Using it to hold casting calls
while actually scouting for victims]

139
00:10:37,460 --> 00:10:38,250
[This is no longer a matter of morality]

140
00:10:38,270 --> 00:10:38,900
[What Zhao Xiao did is outright criminal!]

141
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:39,670
[I was lured to Spotlight Bar
under the pretense of meeting a director]

142
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,840
Last time,
it was a raunchy dance at a bar.

143
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:40,110
[I was almost forced
to drink with clients.]

144
00:10:40,110 --> 00:10:40,520
[I cried all night
when I saw Zhao Xiao get arrested.]

145
00:10:40,550 --> 00:10:41,450
[Thank you to the person who spoke up.]

146
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,750
-This time, he rented out the whole place.
-What a messed-up industry.

147
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,290
[I also hope everyone will
show more concern for girls like me.]

148
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:44,350
[Zhao Xiao; Bar Surveillance Footage;
Arrested for Exploiting Girls]

149
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:44,910
This evidence is pretty damning.

150
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:45,310
[Trending now]

151
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:45,480
I was just starting
to think better of him,

152
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,240
and now this?

153
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:50,590
His reputation was finally recovering,
and now it's in ruins again.

154
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:54,840
Mr. Zhao Xiao,

155
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,200
how do you explain

156
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,510
the crimes your younger brother,
Zhao Fang,

157
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:59,110
has confessed to the police?

158
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,630
-Everyone, please make way.
-It's been reported that your brother,

159
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:02,910
Zhao Fang,
claims all the illegal activities

160
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:03,870
at his bar, Spotlight Bar,

161
00:11:03,870 --> 00:11:05,200
were carried out under your instructions.

162
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,240
Is that true?

163
00:11:07,910 --> 00:11:08,550
Mr. Zhao Xiao,

164
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,610
could you comment?

165
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,320
Please answer the question.

166
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,480
Just a few words,

167
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,010
Mr. Zhao.

168
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,180
Of course that's not true.

169
00:11:16,630 --> 00:11:18,510
I invested in Zhao Fang's bar

170
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:20,510
to support his business.

171
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,720
I've already told the police
everything I needed to.

172
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,630
Thank you.

173
00:11:26,910 --> 00:11:30,240
Also, although Zhao Fang
and I aren't biological brothers,

174
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,360
I have to admit

175
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,430
that I haven't
fulfilled my responsibilities

176
00:11:32,430 --> 00:11:34,430
as his older brother over the years.

177
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:37,000
I'm deeply sorry for what he's done.
